<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $2.3 bln in Jan 15 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $2.3 bln in Jan 15 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $2.3 billion to $788.5 billion in the week ended Jan 15, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
